    "body": "```html\r\n<style>input + div { border:1em solid blue } input:checked + div { border-color:yellow }</style>\r\n<input type=checkbox checked><div></div>\r\n<input type=checkbox checked><div></div>\r\n<script>document.querySelector(\"input\").indeterminate = true</script>\r\n```",
